<title>UK: UK notes in circulation rise 8.0 pct.</title>
<headline>UK notes in circulation rise 8.0 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>British bank notes in circulation rose 8.0 percent in the week to October 2 over the equivalent year-ago week, data released by the Bank of England showed. Last week the annual rise was 7.9 percent.</p>
<p>NOTES IN CIRCULATION (in rounded bln stg) -</p>
<p>				Latest week  pvs week	yr-ago week</p>
<p> Notes in circulation     20.87	 20.82	    19.33</p>
<p> Bankers' deposits	   1.84	  1.84	    1.65</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 5109</p>
